From 51382818f4d43c35d8e7789a491b8689837beb9b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 13:46:26 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(desktop): bring session-outcome under the
 code-health caps [daveey]

- Stripe hook + component move to sidebar/session-row-stripe.tsx (one
  component for the bar and the glyph); session-row shrinks.
- derivedStatusStripe split into isStuck / parkedStripe / settledStripe.
- Outcome types move to types/session-outcome.ts; row status copy (kanban,
  process badges, outcome tooltips) moves to i18n/en_session_row_status.ts
  and types_session_row_status.ts, unresolved reasons as a table.
- Stale-notice spreads and the list signature's status stamps become helpers;
  committedDuringTurn moves to its own module to offset utils.ts.

No behaviour change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
